sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Keys as authorized_keys
    participant Pair as whipair
    participant SSHD as sshd :22
    actor User
    participant Whip as Whip client

    Pair->>Pair: Generate temporary Ed25519 credential
    Pair->>Pair: Open private local Unix socket
    Pair->>Keys: Add restrict + forced-command temporary key
    Pair-->>User: Show one-time WP4 QR code
    User->>Whip: Scan QR code
    Note over Pair,Whip: SSH endpoint + username + temporary seed + host-key pin
    Whip->>SSHD: Connect and verify pinned SSH host key
    Whip->>SSHD: Authenticate with temporary key
    SSHD->>Pair: Start forced exchange command
    Whip->>SSHD: EnrollmentRequest on channel stdin
    SSHD->>Pair: Relay request over private Unix socket
    Pair->>Pair: Validate permanent public key
    Pair-->>User: Show device and key fingerprint
    User->>Pair: Approve or reject
    alt User approves before expiry
        Pair->>Keys: Append permanent key idempotently
        Pair-->>SSHD: approved response
        SSHD-->>Whip: approved response
        Pair->>Keys: Remove temporary key
        Pair->>Pair: Close socket and stop
        Whip->>Whip: Store verified SSH host key
    else User rejects
        Pair-->>SSHD: rejected response
        SSHD-->>Whip: rejected response
        Pair->>Pair: Continue until success or expiry
    end
